      "created_at": "2024-01-07T02:31:57.155Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This ended a game recently, and it doesn’t seem accurate, so I was curious on others interpretation of the final level of the power:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>In every land in the game: X Damage, where X is the number of Presence you have in and adjacent to that land.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>If I have one land with 7 Presence (and nothing adjacent) and target that land, does every land in the game take 7 damage? Or is the damage calculated per land based on its individual Presence and adjacencies?</p>",
