      "created_at": "2024-01-07T02:39:04.748Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It’s the second thing. The damage is figured independently for every land. So if you had a land with 5 <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/dcf579103cd83d8511edc1208e33ff4408dcb1f1.png?v=12\" title=\":presence:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom\" alt=\":presence:\"> in / adjacent to it and another land with 3 <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/dcf579103cd83d8511edc1208e33ff4408dcb1f1.png?v=12\" title=\":presence:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom\" alt=\":presence:\"> in / adjacent to it, the first would take 5 damage and the second 3 damage. So you don’t deal any damage in lands that have none of your <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/dcf579103cd83d8511edc1208e33ff4408dcb1f1.png?v=12\" title=\":presence:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom\" alt=\":presence:\"> in / adjacent to them.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2024-01-07T02:39:04.748Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
