      "title_is_group": false,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "It's the second thing. The damage is figured independently for every land. So if you had a land with 5 :presence: in / adjacent to it and another land with 3 :presence: in / adjacent to it, the first would take 5 damage and the second 3 damage. So you don't deal any damage in lands that have none of your :presence: in / adjacent to them.",
